Sunny is a port (translation) of Vicinae's core features from C++23/Qt to Rust,
with a Tauri v2 (WebView2) front-end replacing the Qt/QML layer.
Sunny is therefore licensed under GPL-3.0 as a derivative work.

Vicinae upstream includes contributions from its sponsors and community.
This project is not affiliated with, nor endorsed by,
Raycast Technologies Inc. or the Vicinae project.

Features of the upstream project that Sunny ports:
app search, clipboard history, file search, emoji picker, calculator, and settings.
Not ported (out of scope): text expander (snippets), extension support,
and AI features.
Emoji dataset: generated from github/gemoji (MIT) via scripts/make-emojis.ps1.

UI font: Inter (SIL Open Font License 1.1), bundled from the Sonora project
(https://github.com/sonorahq/sonora, assets/fonts). Sunny labels this option
"Sonora (Inter)" and uses it as the default typeface. Sonora is a design
reference only — Sunny is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Sonora project.
